### REST client routes for the contacts API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Home page
GET http://localhost:3001
Accept: text/html

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: application/json

### Get one contact by id
GET http://localhost:3001/6a09bbdd5966928964381cf9
Accept: application/json

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3001/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "email": "iriebyupathway.edu",
    "userName": "IrieBi",
    "name": "Elvis Oluwafemi",
    "ipAddress": "192.168.1.12"
  }

### Update a contact by id
PUT http://localhost:3001/6a09bbdd5966928964381cf9 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "email": "iriebyupathway.edu",
    "userName": "IriebBi",
    "name": "Elvis Oluwafemi",
    "ipAddress": "192.168.1.12"
  }

### Delete a contact by id
DELETE http://localhost:3001/6a0bbf5638dab8392b92aae0

### Render HTML contacts list
GET http://localhost:3001/
Accept: text/html
